ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Handball players;\n-  Healthy;\n-  Participation of at least one official match in the last year and attend 70% of the team\'s activities during the current season.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Handball players;",\n          "Observation": [\n            "Handball players"\n          ],\n          "Observation-Name": [\n            "Handball players"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Healthy;",\n          "Condition": [\n            "Healthy"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "Healthy"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Participation of at least one official match in the last year",\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "at least one",\n            "last year"\n          ],\n          "Observation": [\n            "Participation of official match"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "at least"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "one"\n          ],\n          "Observation-Name": [\n            "Participation of official match"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n            "last"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n            "year"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "and attend 70% of the team\'s activities during the current season.",\n          "Observation": [\n            "team\'s activities"\n          ],\n          "Observation-Name": [\n            "team\'s activities"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "70%",\n            "current season"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "70"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Unit": [\n            "%"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n            "current"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n            "season"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
