ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  age ≥18 years\n-  BMI ≤40 kg/m2\n-  indication for hysterectomy for benign disease or prophylactic surgery due to hereditary cancer\n-  indication for radical hysterectomy and/or pelvic-/para-aortic (sentinel-node) lymphadenectomy for cervical cancer\n-  indication for modified radical hysterectomy and/or pelvic-/para-aortic (sentinel-node) lymphadenectomy for endometrial cancer\n-  size of uterus and vagina allows for retrieval by the vaginal route in cancer patients\n-  written informed consent\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "AND": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "raw_text": "- age ≥18 years",\n                                  "Age": [\n                                    "age"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                    "≥18 years"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                                    "≥"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Value": [\n                                    "18"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                                    "years"\n                                  ]\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n                                  "raw_text": "- BMI ≤40 kg/m2",\n                                  "Observation": [\n                                    "BMI"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Observation-Name": [\n                                    "BMI"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                    "≤40 kg/m2"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                                    "≤"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Value": [\n                                    "40"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Unit": [\n                                    "kg",\n                                    "m2"\n                                  ]\n                                }\n                              }\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "OR": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "raw_text": "- indication for hysterectomy for benign disease",\n                                  "Procedure": [\n                                    "hysterectomy"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                                    "hysterectomy"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Indication": [\n                                    "indication"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Modifier": [\n                                    "benign disease"\n                              