ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Pregnant women\n-  Additional colon resection is planned (i.e. left colectomy or proctectomy)\n-  Vulnerable populations such as prisoners or adults unable to give consent\n-  If the scheduled surgery is planned at Butterworth hospital (as to standardize the nursing care received postoperatively)\n-  Emergent cases\nPatients will be excluded from the study intra-operatively if:\n-  The procedure is converted to an open resection\n-  If a loop ileostomy is performed in addition to the right colectomy\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "AND": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "AND": {\n                                    "left": {\n                                      "raw_text": "- Pregnant women",\n                                      "Condition": [\n                                        "Pregnant"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Condition-Name": [\n                                        "Pregnant"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n                                        "women"\n                                      ]\n                                    },\n                                    "right": {\n                                      "OR": {\n                                        "left": {\n                                          "raw_text": "- Additional colon resection is planned (i.e. left colectomy",\n                                          "Procedure": [\n                                            "colon resection",\n                                            "left colectomy"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Procedure-Name": [\n                                            "colon resection",\n                                            "left colectomy"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                            "planned"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                                            "planned"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Modifier": [\n                                            "Additional"\n                                          ]\n                                        },\n                                        "right": {\n                                          "raw_text": "or proctectomy)",\n                                          "Procedure": [\n                                            "proctectomy"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Procedure-Name": [\n                                            "proctectomy"\n                                          ]\n                                        }\n                                      }\n                                    }\n                                  }\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n                                  "OR": {\n                                    "left": {\n                                      "raw_text": "- Vulnerable populations such as prisoners",\n                                      "Observation": [\n                                        "Vulnerable populations"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Observation-Name": [\n                                        "Vulnerable populations"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                        "such as"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Eq-Operator": [\n                                        "such as"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Observation": [\n                                        "prisoners"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Observation-Name": [\n                                        "prisoners"\n                                      ]\n                                    },\n                                    "right": {\n                                      "raw_text": "or adults unable to give consent",\n                                      "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n                                        "adults"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Assertion": [\n                                        "unable to give consent"\n                                      ]\n                                    }\n                                  }\n                                }\n                              }\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "raw_text": "- If the scheduled surgery is planned at Butterworth hospital (as to standardize the nursing care received postoperatively)",\n                              "Procedure": [\n                                "surgery"\n                              ],\n                              "Procedure-Name": [\n                                "surgery"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                "scheduled",\n                                "planned"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                                "scheduled",\n                                "planned"\n                              ],\n                              "Location": [\n                                "Butterworth hospital"\n                              ],\n                              "Provider": [\n                                "nursing care"\n                              ],\n                              "Procedure": [\n                                "operatively"\n                              ]\n                            }\n                          }\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "raw_text": "- Emergent cases",\n                          "Modifier": [\n                            "Emergent"\n                          ]\n                        }\n                      }\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "Patients will be excluded from the study intra-operatively if:",\n                      "Procedure": [\n                        "intra-operatively"\n                      ],\n                      "Procedure-Name": [\n                        "intra-operatively"\n                      ],\n                      "Study": [\n                        "study"\n                      ],\n                      "Assertion": [\n                        "will be"\n                      ],\n                      "Negation": [\n                        