ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Patients undergoing emergency surgery\n-  Endoscopic procedures\n-  Non-oncological gastric surgery\n-  Patients who refuse to participate\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Patients undergoing emergency surgery",\n                  "Procedure": [\n                    "surgery"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                    "surgery"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "undergoing"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                    "undergoing"\n                  ],\n                  "Modifier": [\n                    "emergency"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Endoscopic procedures",\n                  "Procedure": [\n                    "Endoscopic procedures"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                    "Endoscopic procedures"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Non-oncological gastric surgery",\n                  "Procedure": [\n                    "gastric surgery",\n                    "surgery"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                    "gastric surgery",