ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-Stroke occurred more than 30 days after the transfer to intensive rehabilitation\nAdditional exclusion criteria for Epigenetic subproject (for retrospective analysis):\n-  history of major psychiatric disorder or recent exacerbation\n-  global aphasia\n-  refusal of the patient to participate in the study.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "-Stroke occurred more than 30 days after the transfer to intensive rehabilitation",\n              "Condition": [\n                "Stroke"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "Stroke"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "more than 30 days"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "more than"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "30"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                "days"\n              ],\n              "Procedure": [\n                "intensive rehabilitation"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "intensive rehabilitation"\n              ],\n              "Encounter": [\n                "transfer"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- history of major psychiatric disorder",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "psychiatric disorder"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "psychiatric disorder"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "history"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                    "history"\n                  ],\n                  "Severity": [\n                    "major"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "or recent exacerbation",\n                  "Coreference": [\n                    "exacerbation"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "recent"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                    "recent"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- global aphasia",\n          "Condition": [\n            "global aphasia"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "global aphasia"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- refusal of the patient to participate in the study.",\n      "Study": [\n        "study"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
